{"id":"ea947a923b719818","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-adelic-points.md","title":"Adelic Points","display":"df-adelic-points — Adelic Points","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-adelic-points","aliases":["58-df-adelic-points"],"display":"df-adelic-points — Adelic Points","depends_on":["[[58-df-adelic]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-adelic-points"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-adelic-points</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-adelic-points — Adelic Points"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4095490ed42eb546\" href=\"?note=4095490ed42eb546\" title=\"58-df-adelic\">58-df-adelic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,P,\\mathbb A_K,K_\\bullet,O_\\bullet,X\\in V\">\\(K,P,\\mathbb A_K,K_\\bullet,O_\\bullet,X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (adele-ring predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4095490ed42eb546\" href=\"?note=4095490ed42eb546\" title=\"58-df-adelic\">58-df-adelic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (finiteness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_X\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbb A_K\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_0(K_\\bullet(v)):v\\in P\\}\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(O_\\bullet)\">\\(D_X\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbb A_K\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_0(K_\\bullet(v)):v\\in P\\}\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(O_\\bullet)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(X,D_X,\\operatorname{ran}(X))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(X,D_X,\\operatorname{ran}(X))\\)</span> (set-coded point-set assignment)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adelic-points}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S(\\mathbb A_K,K,P,K_\\bullet,O_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,D_X,\\operatorname{ran}(X))\n\\to X(\\mathbb A_K)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{x\\in\\prod_{v\\in P}X(\\pi_0(K_\\bullet(v))):\n\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{v\\in P:x(v)\\notin X(O_\\bullet(v))\\}\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adelic-points}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S(\\mathbb A_K,K,P,K_\\bullet,O_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,D_X,\\operatorname{ran}(X))\n\\to X(\\mathbb A_K)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{x\\in\\prod_{v\\in P}X(\\pi_0(K_\\bullet(v))):\n\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{v\\in P:x(v)\\notin X(O_\\bullet(v))\\}\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The definition reads each local-field carrier as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_0(K_\\bullet(v))\">\\(\\pi_0(K_\\bullet(v))\\)</span> from the exact package used by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S\\)</span>, and uses the supplied distinguished subring <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_\\bullet(v)\">\\(O_\\bullet(v)\\)</span> for the integrality condition.</li>\n<li>The definition is relative to a set-coded point-set assignment <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>; it does not treat <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> as the codomain of a set function.</li>\n<li>A diagonal map from global points requires <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> to be included in the domain of the point-set assignment and is not asserted here.</li>\n<li>Fibration method: if base has points and fibers have Hasse principle, so does total.</li>\n<li>Hilbert's theorem 90: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^1(K, \\mathbb{G}_m) = 0\">\\(H^1(K, \\mathbb{G}_m) = 0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Local-global principle fails but Brauer–Manin may repair it.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-adelic","status":"resolved","id":"4095490ed42eb546","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-adelic]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-adelic","status":"resolved","id":"4095490ed42eb546","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (adele-ring predicate, see [[58-df-adelic]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (finiteness predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,P,\\mathbb A_K,K_\\bullet,O_\\bullet,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"D_X\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbb A_K\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_0(K_\\bullet(v)):v\\in P\\}\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(O_\\bullet)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(X,D_X,\\operatorname{ran}(X))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adelic-points}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S(\\mathbb A_K,K,P,K_\\bullet,O_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,D_X,\\operatorname{ran}(X))\n\\to X(\\mathbb A_K)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{x\\in\\prod_{v\\in P}X(\\pi_0(K_\\bullet(v))):\n\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{v\\in P:x(v)\\notin X(O_\\bullet(v))\\}\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi_0(K_\\bullet(v))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S","display":false},{"tex":"O_\\bullet(v)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"H^1(K, \\mathbb{G}_m) = 0","display":false}],"bytes":1885,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-adelic-points.md|58-df-adelic-points]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["4095490ed42eb546","d9a25b0ac94a3598","36d7463d215be751"]}